<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.93 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 23.50 basis points to 31.93 percent on Wednesday, from 32.1650 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP fell 174.30 percentage points to 31.9243 percent on Wednesday from 33.6673 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
